// 用例目的：枚举参数 dayCountConvention 传入非法取值 —— 文档：任何其他字符串均回退到函数指定的默认日计数，验证回退行为（预期：不抛异常）
@testing:case="createVanillaBondTemplate accepts invalid enum for dayCountConvention (falls back to default)"
rVbtDc = caplib::createVanillaBondTemplate("TF_FI_BOND_TPL_FB_DC", "FIXED_COUPON_BOND", asOfDate, 1, asOfDate, "1Y", 0.0, currency, 100.0, "NOT_A_REAL_ENUM", "CAL_CFETS", "ANNUAL", "MODIFIED_FOLLOWING", "INITIAL", "LONG", 0, "MODIFIED_FOLLOWING", "", "", "INVALID_FREQUENCY", "INVALID_BUSINESS_DAY_CONVENTION", "INVALID_DATE_GENERATION_MODE", -1, "0d", "", "INVALID_BUSINESS_DAY_CONVENTION", false, "CONST_NOTIONAL", 0.0, true)
assert 1, typestr(rVbtDc) != "VOID"

// 用例目的：枚举参数 frequency 传入非法取值 —— 包装层将未知值回退（源码解析回退、不报错），验证宽松接受（预期：不抛异常）
